<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 56, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#BFD5EF', letterSpacing: 2 }}>01 这是什么产品</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#BFD5EF' }}>水产 AI 可信性工程</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>三层价值，一次说清</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>这三层不是三个产品，是一条链；单独任何一层都撑不起立项</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 16, height: 520, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 18, height: 136, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 76, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>01</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>输入可信</Text>
                    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, height: 26, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 13, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>E3 环境 · 技术环节</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    保证进到模型里的数据是干净的。价值锚在
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>研究缺口</span>。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 18, height: 136, background: '#E8EFF8', border: '2px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 76, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1 }}>02</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>输出可信</Text>
                    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, height: 26, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 13, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>E10 · 主命题</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    保证说出去的话有数据支持、出错能被追责。
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>立论落在这里。</span>
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 18, height: 136, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 76, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>03</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>数据来源</Text>
                    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, height: 26, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 13, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>E8 环境 · 技术环节</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    不进塘口、不装传感器也能拿到数据。
                    这一环回答「你们的数据从哪来」。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, height: 42, background: '#0E3F8C' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.35, flex: 1 }}>
                主命题是中间那层。
                <span style={{ color: '#FFC107', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>两侧是技术路线的支撑环节，不并列成子课题。</span>
            </Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>三层链划分依据：16 方向审查的总览「推荐的重组主线」｜E3 价值表述遵循其门禁 A 的硬约束（不包装为商业机会）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>05 / 14</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
